h","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_20","text":"Oh, forgive me. I have yet to introduce myself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_21","text":"I am Ludmilla.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_22","text":"I oversee Snowfield Hot Spring and guide those who lose their way in the snowy mountains.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_23","text":"My name's Mica! I help Ludmilla out at Snowfield Hot Spring!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_24","text":"It's a pleasure to meet you, Ludmilla-san, Mica-san.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_25","text":"I'm Yukiko Amagi. Please call me Yukiko.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_26","text":"So, I hear you'd like to look around Snowfield Hot Spring?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_27","text":"Yes, I'd love to.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_28","text":"When I heard there were hot springs in this world too, I couldn't help but get curious.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_29","text":"I wanted to see what they're like...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_30","text":"Y-you said you're the heiress to an inn, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_31","text":"That's right. My family runs a hot spring inn, so someday, I'll also...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_32","text":"I-I see...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_33","text":"I have to admit... I'm a little nervous.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_34","text":"We've never had someone who does this for a living as a guest before... Hehe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_35","text":"Haha, there's really no need to feel so pressured.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_36","text":"I'm not really here to evaluate anything. It's more like I'm just on a vacation,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_37","text":"so I'd love to see what things are usually like around here. Please don't feel like you have to go out of your way for me!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_38","text":"Haha, Yukiko is quite right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_39","text":"At Snowfield Hot Spring, our philosophy is that everyone who visits should be able to rest in comfort.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_40","text":"I'm certain she won't be disappointed, so there's no need to worry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_41","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_41","text":"I'm actually looking forward to this too. It's been a while.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_42","text":"Would you be so kind as to show our guests around, Mica?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_43","text":"I'll be with you as soon as I've finished attending to a few matters.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica_w","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_44","text":"Of course! Leave it to me!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_02_02_45","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_02_02_45","text":"With that, Mica spends the next few hours","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"BigHo